SUMMARY:The Bakery: How PEP810 sped up my bread operations business
DESCRIPTION:Discover how PEP 810's explicit lazy imports can dramatically improve Python application startup times. Using a real CLI tool as a case study, that we totally use in our real business, this talk demonstrates practical techniques to optimize import performance while maintaining code clarity and safety.
