 <p>It is said that learning too much about the dark corners of this ancient knowledge might drive one mad.</p>
 <p>Here is your chance to learn mostly useless things about DNS!</p>
 <p>This presentation will cover quirks of the DNS protocol which are probably surprising, and hopefully interesting.</p>
 <p>Warning: Due to constraints no entities from beyond time and space will be summoned during this talk.</p>
